# summaries/ and transcripts/ ARE tracked so you can read them on GitHub
# (the workflow commits them, and SUMMARIES.md is the index page for your
# daily read). If your repo is public and the content is private, make the
# repo private.
# subscriptions.yaml IS tracked so GitHub Actions can read your list (it's just
# links, not secrets).
# state.json IS tracked — GitHub Actions commits it to remember what's been summarized.
